<title>USA: Comstock completes public offering.</title>
<headline>Comstock completes public offering.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Comstock Resources Inc said on Wednesday it completed a public offering of 5.795 million shares of common stock at a price to the public of $12.50 per share on November 25.</p>
<p>The shares offered included 4 million sold by the company and 1.795 million shares sold by certain selling stockholders. After completion of the offering, the company has a total of 23,191,630 shares of common stock outstanding, the statement said.</p>
<p>Comstock, up 1/16 at 12-5/8 minutes after trading opened, is an independent oil and gas company.</p>
</text>
